{
  "analysis": "We need extract a suitable still from the trailer and set it as the desktop wallpaper. The desktop environment and available video tools need to be identified first.",
  "plan": "Locate the video, inspect desktop configuration tools, and check for ffmpeg so a frame can be extracted and applied as wallpaper.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -lh ~/Desktop; printenv | grep -E 'DISPLAY|DBUS|DESKTOP'; command -v ffmpeg ffprobe gsettings xfconf-query pcmanfm feh; pgrep -a -f 'xfdesktop|plasmashell|gnome-shell|pcmanfm|dbus-daemon'\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The trailer and ffmpeg are available, but there is no desktop session environment or standard wallpaper-setting tool visible in the current shell.",
  "plan": "Inspect running processes, installed desktop applications, and display sockets to determine how the graphical desktop is managed. Also inspect the video to choose an appropriate frame.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "ps aux | head -45; ls -la /tmp/.X11-unix /run/user/$(id -u) 2>/dev/null; ls /usr/bin | grep -Ei 'wall|desktop|xfce|xrandr|xset|dconf|gsettings|vlc'; ls -la ~; ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration:stream=width,height -of default=noprint_wrappers=1 ~/Desktop/*.mp4\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "This environment has VLC but no running graphical desktop or X display. A persistent wallpaper setting may need to be stored for a desktop session rather than applied to a currently visible desktop.",
  "plan": "Inspect existing configuration and available packages to identify the intended wallpaper backend, and finish probing the video.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "find ~/.config ~/.local /app -maxdepth 3 -type f 2>/dev/null | head -80; cat /etc/os-release; sudo -n true && echo sudo_available; dpkg -l | grep -Ei 'xfce|gnome|xserver|feh|wallpaper|lxde|openbox|dbus'; ffprobe -v error -show_entries format=duration:stream=width,height -of default=noprint_wrappers=1 \"$HOME/Desktop/Interstellar Movie - Official Trailer.mp4\"\n",
      "duration": 1
    }
  ]
}

